{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブレポは\n１つの会場が終わるごとになので\n今日が終わったら書きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でね、\n聞いてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんが中田の肩で寝てたの！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10分44秒\n中田の肩にひめたんが寄りかかってくれてたの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、寄りかかってる事に気づいたのか\nまっすぐに戻っちゃって\nちょっと残念に思ってたら\nまた寄りかかってきて\n28秒間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかし、ひめたん\n震動で起きちゃった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかし、また倒れてきた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかし、\nひめたんの頭と中田の肩の間に\nあと2センチくらい距離があって\n微妙に寄りかかってこない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/23/8148981/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから\n中田は左肩をあげて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/23/8148981/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寄りかからせて\nぴったし70秒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時計見てたわけじゃなくて\nひめたんの頭が肩に寄りかかってる間\nじっと数を数えていたから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/23/8148981/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心拍数上がってて\n秒数は実際もうちょっと\n短かったかもしれないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"約742秒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"至福の時でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごちそうさまでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日23日20:30～ の 乃木ののは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃん、らりん、中田"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回からきいちゃんがMCになりたてで\n新鮮な感じで楽しかった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶん全国ツアーの話もしてるので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーに来た方も\nこれから大阪、神宮来る方も\n残念ながら今年来れなかった方も\n聴いてほしいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/23/8148981/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/23/8148981/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント\nたくさんありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日でも選抜発表後でも\nなんでも無いブログなのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田ブログを\nこんなにたくさんの方が読んでくれた事が\nすごい嬉しいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/23/8148981/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}